------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2] LEVEL 3: the 0++ atom.  In 2D, O = tr F^2 = the transfer generator => nu = 0, gap > 0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2D: the spatial slice has no plaquette, so H = (g^2/2) sum_links E^2 = the Casimir,
   and tr F^2 is proportional to the electric energy, i.e. to H - E_0.  Hence on the vacuum
       <Omega|O(t)O(0)|Omega>_conn = 0   for all t,   so the Kallen-Lehmann measure
       nu_{trF^2} = 0 identically  =>  f_1^2 = nu({m_1^2}) = 0.
   The mass gap, however, is positive and exact: m_1 = -log(lam_{1/2}/lam_0) > 0.
  beta= 0.5:  m_1 = 1.42630950 > 0     f_1^2 = 0 (nu empty)    max|connected| = 0.0e+00
  beta= 2.5:  m_1 = 0.32942035 > 0     f_1^2 = 0 (nu empty)    max|connected| = 0.0e+00
  beta= 4.0:  m_1 = 0.19936671 > 0     f_1^2 = 0 (nu empty)    max|connected| = 0.0e+00
    [PASS] 2.1 a strictly positive gap coexists with an EMPTY spectral measure (f_1^2 = 0) gap > 0 and atom = 0 at the same time
    [PASS] 2.2 hence Level 3 (atom + positive residue) is logically INDEPENDENT of Levels 1-2 2D YM: Levels 1-2 hold (gap > 0), Level 3 fails (no atom) -- witness is exact
    the sufficient condition for the atom is the residue-level-gap lemma (GAP-G2-edge L2):
      f_1^2 >= (Lambda M_0 - M_1)/(Lambda - m_1^2),  which needs the ISOLATION datum
      Lambda > M_1/M_0 -- a second scale.  With nu = 0 the lemma returns 0: the gap alone
      cannot produce it.  (And Clay asks only for the gap, so Level 3 is ABOVE Clay.)

==============================================================================
VERDICT
==============================================================================
  [1] the gauge projection costs exactly 1 (2D exact; and >= 1 in general by min-max).
  [2] the gap does NOT imply the atom: 2D YM has m_1 > 0 and f_1^2 = 0 exactly.
  => Level 3 is independent, and it is strictly stronger than the Clay statement.
==============================================================================
